  "prefLabel": "Liq 602.05 Penalties For Violating Commission Orders",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Liq 602.05 Penalties For Violating Commission Orders. The presiding officer shall impose a penalty as provided in Liq 602.01(a), on any licensee who fails to comply with the requirements of a commission order.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Liq 600) #13983, eff 5-24-24",
